WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.067 --> 00:00:09.980
My mom always tells us to eat good food.

2
00:00:09.981 --> 00:00:14.137
We are not allowed to buy any junk food.

3
00:00:14.138 --> 00:00:16.163
Hana: When are we eating, Mom?

4
00:00:16.164 --> 00:00:19.100
Mom: As soon as your brother comes home.

5
00:00:19.101 --> 00:00:21.354
Hana: What are we having today?

6
00:00:21.355 --> 00:00:22.811
Mom: Spaghetti.

7
00:00:22.812 --> 00:00:26.344
Hana: Yum, that's my favorite!

8
00:00:26.345 --> 00:00:28.204
Bada: I'm home, Mom.

9
00:00:28.205 --> 00:00:31.599
Mom: Hi, Bada. Go wash your hands please.

10
00:00:31.602 --> 00:00:34.319
Lunch is almost ready.

11
00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:36.095
Bada: I'm not hungry.

12
00:00:36.096 --> 00:00:38.432
Can I go out and play?

13
00:00:38.433 --> 00:00:41.013
Mom: No, come and eat right now.

14
00:00:41.014 --> 00:00:43.388
Your sister is waiting.

15
00:00:43.389 --> 00:00:46.032
Bada: Can I play after lunch then?

16
00:00:46.033 --> 00:00:48.403
Mom: Sure you can.

17
00:00:48.404 --> 00:00:51.746
My brother is not interested in food.

18
00:00:51.747 --> 00:00:56.240
He is only interested in toys and his friends.
